{
  "id": "Lyo.Podcast.Postgres",
  "name": "Lyo.Podcast.Postgres",
  "area": "Plugins",
  "tagline": "PostgreSQL and EF Core implementation of `Lyo.Podcast.IPodcastStore`.",
  "description": "PostgreSQL and EF Core implementation of `Lyo.Podcast.IPodcastStore` (`PostgresPodcastStore`) via `PodcastDbContext`, schema `podcast`, and `AddPostgresMigrations`. `PostgresPodcastStore` implements `Lyo.Health.IHealth`.",
  "features": [
    "**Schema `podcast`.** Shows, seasons, episodes, credits, identifiers, and genres.",
    "**Constraints.** Unique slug, identifier `(scheme, normalized value)` per owner table, and season and episode numbers.",
    "**Text.** Stored `tsvector` column and GIN index on episode transcripts.",
    "**DI.** `AddPodcastDbContextFactory` / `AddPostgresPodcastStore` and `FromConfiguration` overloads (section `PostgresPodcast`)."
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Registration",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "services.AddPostgresPodcastStore(o => {\n    o.ConnectionString = connStr;\n    o.EnableAutoMigrations = true;\n});"
    }
  ],
